  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the oven to 375 degrees.",
    "Slice the tomatoes into 1/4 inch thick rounds and place on a baking sheet.",
    "Drizzle the olive oil over the tomatoes and sprinkle with salt, pepper, and oregano.",
    "Roast the tomatoes in the oven for 20 minutes, or until they are tender and lightly caramelized.",
    "In a small bowl, mix together the garlic and goat cheese.",
    "Spoon the garlic and goat cheese mixture over the roasted tomatoes.",
    "Transfer the tomatoes to individual mini cocottes and top with chopped fresh basil.",
    "Bake the gratin in the oven for an additional 10 minutes, or until the cheese is melted and bubbly."
  ],
